{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53186","headline":"诗偈 十一 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日在有时，常被有人欺，一相（《宗镜录》卷四八作「总总」）生分别，见闻多是非。\n已後入无时（《宗镜录》作「後向无中坐」），又被无人欺，一向看心坐，冥冥无所知。\n有无俱是执，何处是无爲？有无同一体，诸相尽皆（《宗镜录》作「皆尽」）离。\n心同虚空故，虚空是我师（《宗镜录》作「无所依」）。\n若论无相理，惟我（《宗镜录》作「有」）父王知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}